WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.384
Imagine this reality: the power grid trips, and within hours backup batteries at cellular towers run completely dry.

2
00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:14.689
Ninety-nine percent of apps go dark instantly. SENDA requires no internet and no central servers to communicate.

3
00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:23.499
Using sixteen acoustic tones between two and five kilohertz, mobile phones handshake directly through airborne soundwaves.

4
00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:31.871
A call signaling packet is compressed into seventy-two bytes, enabling encrypted direct voice calls inside any blackout shelter.

5
00:00:33.471 --> 00:00:41.172
When civilization goes dark, your emergency message survives. Open SENDA in your mobile browser and keep your community linked.

6
00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:47.453
Explore the interactive platform at civic-relay-investor dot vercel dot app slash senda.
